Hey there,

Quick one this week. I spent ten days with the new version of the
field recorder and the headline feature is the one I told them not
to build: a physical button. A real one. You press it and it
records, which is a radical idea in a category that spent five
years moving everything behind a touchscreen.

The battery is honest this time =E2=80=94 19 hours measured, not 20
advertised. The preamps are clean enough that I stopped reaching
for my external box, which is the only compliment that counts here.

Full write-up when the lab data is in. Reply and tell me what you
want me to measure.

